{"3822240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Strange island", "steam_appid": 3822240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5069750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a tropical island in the middle of the ocean. No memories. No idea who you are — or how you ended up here.<br>Surrounded by waves and sand, you begin to make your way inland, through dense forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the island, you come across a strange house. It appears abandoned, but inside, everything feels like someone just stepped out for a moment. At the same time, there’s something oddly familiar about the place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and the island, a quiet unease begins to settle in. You can’t shake the feeling that you’re not alone.<br>Is this some kind of experiment? A dream? Are you losing your mind?<br>Or is there something else… waiting?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a tropical island in the middle of the ocean. No memories. No idea who you are — or how you ended up here.<br>Surrounded by waves and sand, you begin to make your way inland, through dense forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the island, you come across a strange house. It appears abandoned, but inside, everything feels like someone just stepped out for a moment. At the same time, there’s something oddly familiar about the place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and the island, a quiet unease begins to settle in. You can’t shake the feeling that you’re not alone.<br>Is this some kind of experiment? A dream? Are you losing your mind?<br>Or is there something else… waiting?</p>", "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror focused on atmosphere, exploration, and a slow descent into mystery. You wake up on a remote island with no memory and no answers — who you are or how you got there. But with every answer you find, more questions begin to surface", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822240/d93fe6555bb94fa32eaa9c8b07d7b01b8983b8c1/header.jpg?t=1788088514", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822240/bfd60b6a6385c2ffc37d008f48fca31811809569/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788088514", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822240/bfd60b6a6385c2ffc37d008f48fca31811809569/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788088514", "website": "https://www.indiedb.com/games/strange-island", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti 4 GB / AMD Radeon RX 560 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Keyboard and mouse required</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Black Bear Studio"], "publishers": ["Black Bear Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 5069750, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822240/03919d3dff9c29f3cc65438c94f6955fe6e25107/ss_03919d3dff9c29f3cc65438c94f69